# Build artefacts.
#
# The built place file IS committed (build/NeonAscent.rbxl) so that anyone
# can clone this repo and open a playable game in Roblox Studio without
# installing the Rojo toolchain. It is the one deliberate exception.
#
# Everything else Rojo/Selene/rendering can regenerate stays out of git.

*.rbxlx
*.rbxm
*.rbxmx
sourcemap.json
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
*.log
